<!-- Resumeboard sitemap. One entry per real page on disk, and no others.

     A page that is a directory index is listed as the directory URL (/examples/,
     /guides/, /ats/, /templates/) so it matches the links in the site
     navigation and the rel=canonical each page declares for itself. The other
     form of the same document, /guides/index.html, must not also appear here:
     two URLs for one document split its canonical signal.

     Deliberately absent:
       404.html                  - noindex, and a sitemap may only list URLs
                                   that can return 200.
       assets/landing-content.html
                                 - an HTML fragment inlined into the marketing
                                   page, never fetched as a document.
       test/smoke.html           - noindex, nofollow smoke-test harness.

     lastmod is each file's modification date. Regenerate with:
       node test/qa-links.js     - fails if a listed URL 404s, if a real page is
                                   missing, or if two entries name one document.
-->
